       "Extracted folder SPEC/: data_by_hole (25 per-hole CSV: Analyte, Concentration (uM), Text ID, Test No., comments) + supplementary_material/raw_data_files per site/hole (100 Cary .BAB batch files, 40 Advanced Reads csv, 44 .xlsm + 1 .xlsx calibration workbooks) + SPEC-README.txt + site-location HTML",
       "Yes - 12 'bdl' results and 1 corrupted value ('4844.82794' followed by a stray byte); one empty raw csv (PO4 PART 1.csv)",
